<InfoPage path="/real-or-fake/" label="Safety check" heading="Is Yarrwin Real or Fake? A Neutral Checklist" title="Is Yarrwin Real or Fake? Safety Checklist" description="A neutral checklist for checking Yarrwin URLs, apps, support messages and payment requests.">
  <h2>Check the destination</h2><p>Read the full domain, confirm HTTPS and compare it with an address from a trusted source. A familiar logo is not proof. Do not enter credentials after following a shortened link you cannot verify.</p>
  <h2>Check the request</h2><p>Promises of guaranteed wins, secret predictors, free balances or urgent payments are warning signs. So are requests for OTPs, remote access or an APK from a private chat.</p>
  <h2>Make a cautious decision</h2><p>Read the platform’s own terms, privacy information, age requirements and support route. This site is an independent informational resource, not an operator or regulator.</p>
</InfoPage>
